WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:15.950
The Magic Barber by John Millen

00:16.000 --> 00:19.950
It is afternoon in crossways.

00:20.000 --> 00:22.950
Crossways is a quiet town.

00:23.000 --> 00:26.950
Crossways is a sleepy town.

00:27.000 --> 00:30.950
Everybody in crossways wears a large hat.

00:31.000 --> 00:35.950
Everybody in crossways wears a black hat.

00:36.000 --> 00:40.950
The women wear round black hats.

00:41.000 --> 00:43.950
The men wear tall black hats.

00:44.000 --> 00:47.950
The girls wear square black hats.

00:48.000 --> 00:52.950
The boys wear flat black hats.

00:53.000 --> 00:55.950
Everybody has long hair.

00:56.000 --> 01:00.950
Everybody wears a large hat.

01:01.000 --> 01:07.950
Everybody wears a large hat over their long hair.

01:08.000 --> 01:10.950
It is afternoon in crossways.

01:11.000 --> 01:13.950
The sun is shining brightly.

01:14.000 --> 01:16.950
It is a hot afternoon.

01:17.000 --> 01:19.950
Everybody is sleeping.

01:20.000 --> 01:23.950
Suddenly there is a loud noise.

01:24.000 --> 01:25.950
Everybody wakes up.

01:26.000 --> 01:28.950
They all look round.

01:29.000 --> 01:30.950
What is happening?

01:31.000 --> 01:34.950
Who is making that loud noise?

01:35.000 --> 01:39.950
A small boy is walking along the street.

01:40.000 --> 01:42.950
He is beating a drum.

01:43.000 --> 01:47.950
The small boy is walking in front of a donkey.

01:48.000 --> 01:51.950
The donkey is pulling a cart.

01:52.000 --> 01:54.950
A man is sitting on the cart.

01:55.000 --> 01:58.950
There is a large notice above the man's head.

01:59.000 --> 02:00.950
The Magic Barber.

02:01.000 --> 02:02.950
Why wear hats?

02:03.000 --> 02:05.950
Have your hair cut all shapes.

02:06.000 --> 02:07.950
All colors.

02:08.000 --> 02:09.950
Only one dollar.

02:10.000 --> 02:12.950
Hurry! Hurry! Hurry!

02:13.000 --> 02:15.950
Everybody reads the notice.

02:16.000 --> 02:19.950
Everybody in crossways is happy.

02:20.000 --> 02:21.950
They don't like black hats.

02:22.000 --> 02:25.950
They don't want to wear hats anymore.

02:26.000 --> 02:28.950
They all shout and cheer.

02:29.000 --> 02:37.950
Hurry! Hurry! Hurry! Hurry!

02:38.000 --> 02:42.950
They all throw their hats in the air.

02:43.000 --> 02:46.950
The wind blows the hats high in the sky.

02:47.000 --> 02:49.950
They all cheer and shout.

02:50.000 --> 02:54.950
Goodbye hats! Goodbye hats!

02:55.000 --> 02:57.950
Nobody sees the small boy.

02:58.000 --> 02:59.950
He is busy.

03:00.000 --> 03:03.950
He is picking up the hats.

03:04.000 --> 03:09.950
The small boy is putting the hats into a large bag.

03:10.000 --> 03:15.950
He fills the large bag with the hats.

03:16.000 --> 03:19.950
The small boy lifts up the large bag.

03:20.000 --> 03:22.950
He runs out of the town.

03:23.000 --> 03:28.000
He is carrying the large bag on his back.

03:32.000 --> 03:35.950
A young man climbs onto the cart.

03:36.000 --> 03:38.950
He sits down on the chair.

03:39.000 --> 03:41.950
He pays the barber a dollar.

03:42.000 --> 03:48.950
The magic barber puts a large white towel over the young man's head.

03:49.000 --> 03:53.950
He waves a large pair of scissors in the air.

03:54.000 --> 03:56.950
He shouts the magic words.

03:57.000 --> 04:03.950
Snip, snip, up and down, round and round and off it comes.

04:04.000 --> 04:07.950
The magic barber pulls away the towel.

04:08.000 --> 04:10.950
Everybody shouts.

04:11.000 --> 04:13.950
The young man's hair is short.

04:14.000 --> 04:18.950
The young man's hair is green.

04:19.000 --> 04:21.950
Everybody shouts and cheers.

04:22.000 --> 04:24.950
Everybody is happy.

04:25.000 --> 04:27.000
Yeah!

04:32.000 --> 04:35.950
The magic barber cuts everybody's hair.

04:36.000 --> 04:38.950
The women have blue hair.

04:39.000 --> 04:41.950
The men have green hair.

04:42.000 --> 04:44.950
The boys have red hair.

04:45.000 --> 04:47.950
The girls have yellow hair.

04:48.000 --> 04:54.000
Nobody in crossways is wearing a hat.

04:56.000 --> 04:59.950
The people of crossways go to bed.

05:00.000 --> 05:02.950
They wake up in the morning.

05:03.000 --> 05:05.950
A young man looks in the mirror.

05:06.000 --> 05:07.950
What has happened?

05:08.000 --> 05:09.950
Where is his hair?

05:10.000 --> 05:12.950
He has no hair.

05:13.000 --> 05:16.000
He is bald.

05:18.000 --> 05:21.950
The people of crossways are angry.

05:22.000 --> 05:23.950
Everybody is bald.

05:24.000 --> 05:26.950
They have no hair.

05:27.000 --> 05:29.950
They want their hats back.

05:30.000 --> 05:31.950
Where is my hat?

05:32.000 --> 05:35.000
I want my hat back.

05:43.000 --> 05:45.950
Suddenly there is a loud noise.

05:46.000 --> 05:49.950
A small boy is walking along the street.

05:50.000 --> 05:52.950
He is blowing a trumpet.

05:53.000 --> 05:56.000
He is blowing the trumpet loudly.

06:03.000 --> 06:07.950
The small boy is walking in front of a donkey.

06:08.000 --> 06:10.950
The donkey is pulling a cart.

06:11.000 --> 06:14.950
A man is sitting on the cart.

06:15.000 --> 06:18.950
The cart is full of black hats.

06:19.000 --> 06:22.950
There is a notice above the cart.

06:23.000 --> 06:25.950
Everybody reads the notice.

06:26.000 --> 06:29.000
They cheer and shout.

06:30.000 --> 06:32.950
Everybody buys a black hat.

06:33.000 --> 06:36.950
The black hats cover their bald heads.

06:37.000 --> 06:39.950
Everybody is happy.

06:40.000 --> 06:41.950
Hats for sale.

06:42.000 --> 06:44.950
All shapes, all sizes.

06:45.000 --> 06:48.000
Only two dollars.
